Important for exams
Remember these points:
- Responsibility = Taking ownership of duties, decisions and actions.
- Respect = Treating people and resources properly.
- Responsibility has 2 main aspirational standards, followed by 4 additional aspirational standards and 2 mandatory standards in your lecture.
- Respect has 4 aspirational standards and 4 mandatory standards.
- Aspirational = Should try to follow.
- Mandatory = Must follow.
